{
"file": 655,
"paths": [
"d008/d050/f018"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "1cf5ff3f",
"en_raw": "What a racket..."
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "13bfccf9",
"en_raw": "...It does feel"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "81501d31",
"en_raw": "heavy-headed"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "eeea2d35",
"en_raw": "Ah!"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "fe33317d",
"en_raw": "My head, ringing"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "dd9658ed",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to go home soon"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "9c27e363",
"en_raw": "Kurumi's head hurts"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "3c82dc91",
"en_raw": "I want to go home soon"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "584cf66e",
"en_raw": "for real"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "bdadc600",
"en_raw": "My head is starting to hurt..."
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "7ab010f2",
"en_raw": "Let's get away from here"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "663440df",
"en_raw": "...As I've told you"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "67f2ccf1",
"en_raw": "many times already"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "d52d0251",
"en_raw": "it's the rules, so there's"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "9fa6e320",
"en_raw": "nothing I can do"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "a29931e3",
"en_raw": "I'm only asking to pray"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "a4a2b832",
"en_raw": "at Lady Naruko's shrine"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "b0f92b16",
"en_raw": "I won't be in the way"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "a631f70d",
"en_raw": "This is trouble..."
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "74fa6534",
"en_raw": "Can't you give up?"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "641da1dd",
"en_raw": "Please, I'm begging you"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "5a059c30",
"en_raw": "Just a little while"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "9dd99cfd",
"en_raw": "It'll only take five minutes..."
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "02df979b",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "0ef76886",
"en_raw": "Don't go inside!"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "ca86af6c",
"en_raw": "(My head hurts..."
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "2ba73228",
"en_raw": "I can't stand this noise)"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "26b6ec85",
"en_raw": "(Let's get away from here quickly...)"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "dd4c6a5c",
"en_raw": "My headache got"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "b5f0e6c9",
"en_raw": "really bad"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "322f4b6b",
"en_raw": "I don't want to go"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "06f92e19",
"en_raw": "any further..."
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "3b3c6ade",
"en_raw": "Oh, sorry..."
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "7c9474d4",
"en_raw": "...My head still hurts"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "4305e91d",
"en_raw": "I'll come back after the"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "d19aa9b7",
"en_raw": "construction is over..."
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "d44a894c",
"en_raw": "...Really, no one's here"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "9c27e363",
"en_raw": "Kurumi's head hurts"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "3c82dc91",
"en_raw": "I want to go home soon"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "ca86af6c",
"en_raw": "(My head hurts..."
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "2ba73228",
"en_raw": "I can't stand this noise)"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "26b6ec85",
"en_raw": "(Let's get away from here quickly...)"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "d0ae082b",
"en_raw": "If you wait there"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "f9e1d562",
"en_raw": "like that"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "3b218b70",
"en_raw": "my work won't finish"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "fe98fe8f",
"en_raw": "Please go home soon"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "b9bd3247",
"en_raw": "No one's here now..."
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "5e8af2ed",
"en_raw": "Go into the construction site?"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "5133663e",
"en_raw": "Go / Don't  My head might hurt again..."
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "cdb5d218",
"en_raw": "It's quiet today..."
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "349a21f5",
"en_raw": "Maybe construction is off"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "9c27e363",
"en_raw": "Kurumi's head hurts"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "3c82dc91",
"en_raw": "I want to go home soon"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "663440df",
"en_raw": "...As I've told you"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "67f2ccf1",
"en_raw": "many times already"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "d52d0251",
"en_raw": "it's the rules, so there's"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "9fa6e320",
"en_raw": "nothing I can do"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "a29931e3",
"en_raw": "I'm only asking to pray"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "a4a2b832",
"en_raw": "at Lady Naruko's shrine"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "b0f92b16",
"en_raw": "I won't be in the way"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "a631f70d",
"en_raw": "This is trouble..."
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "74fa6534",
"en_raw": "Can't you give up?"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "641da1dd",
"en_raw": "Please, I'm begging you"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "5a059c30",
"en_raw": "Just a little while"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "9dd99cfd",
"en_raw": "It'll only take five minutes..."
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "02df979b",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "0ef76886",
"en_raw": "Don't go inside!"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "02df979b",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "15c5f125",
"en_raw": "Please wait a moment"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "02df979b",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "776b5756",
"en_raw": "So that's how it is"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "7f63e9e0",
"en_raw": "Um, let's see... oh, hello"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "402416ef",
"en_raw": "Sorry for the odd question"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "41ca56e5",
"en_raw": "May I ask?"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "e62ebe2d",
"en_raw": "What is it?"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "89fd1007",
"en_raw": "if that's okay"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "5cb55887",
"en_raw": "There's a rumor that people get"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "4f924a00",
"en_raw": "headaches when passing around here"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "89135a69",
"en_raw": "Mr. Guard, do you ever"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "fc39606e",
"en_raw": "get a headache?"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "a25dabf4",
"en_raw": "Hmm, let me think..."
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "26a5a1d6",
"en_raw": "Well, there are days like that"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "c7e6b41e",
"en_raw": "but mostly"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "693ce441",
"en_raw": "it's when I drank too much last night"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "3c392ad9",
"en_raw": "or have a bit of a cold"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "174b594d",
"en_raw": "That kind of thing, and"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "84d3f74c",
"en_raw": "otherwise I'd say"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "c59ba958",
"en_raw": "I'm perfectly normal"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "fa7f845f",
"en_raw": "Is there something"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "11bb1739",
"en_raw": "strange going on?"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "51ade3ef",
"en_raw": "Could it be because"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "a64cadb8",
"en_raw": "the big tree at the site"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "20970722",
"en_raw": "was cut down..."
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "7f7386a9",
"en_raw": "No, I don't think"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "780898a3",
"en_raw": "it's anything like that"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "95f51dfa",
"en_raw": "Look at me, I'm"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "524f4b34",
"en_raw": "perfectly healthy..."
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "190fa071",
"en_raw": "And the site itself"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "280c8527",
"en_raw": "has no problems at all"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "19c5a9b7",
"en_raw": "It's dangerous"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "e9705116",
"en_raw": "so please stay away"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "a19d3817",
"en_raw": "Cutting down Lord Naruko"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "1c63abfd",
"en_raw": "such sacrilege..."
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "782ba340",
"en_raw": "...Excuse me"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "54fb65b3",
"en_raw": "that Naruko"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "ad2c0e30",
"en_raw": "you've mentioned"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "d4420cf0",
"en_raw": "since the other day..."
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "e62ebe2d",
"en_raw": "What is it?"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "81d51718",
"en_raw": "A naruko, you see"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "f140ef93",
"en_raw": "you young ones"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "f3917121",
"en_raw": "may never have seen one"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "0a2875d3",
"en_raw": "It's a thin rope with lots of"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "29fd31f4",
"en_raw": "boards and thin bamboo tubes"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "01ca1326",
"en_raw": "When a bird lands on it"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "090c7b87",
"en_raw": "it clatters, rattle rattle"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "e82e6204",
"en_raw": "and the bird gets startled"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "655443b5",
"en_raw": "and flies away"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "7943699a",
"en_raw": "They used to be in old fields"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "dde7dc9e",
"en_raw": "So that's \"Lord Naruko\"?"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "606ec8fd",
"en_raw": "Oh my, no"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "06b46e45",
"en_raw": "Lord Naruko is"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "e480d240",
"en_raw": "the sacred tree of Narukozuka"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "2e795122",
"en_raw": "It was a magnificent tree"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "55c45aba",
"en_raw": "Haven't you seen it?"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "ec1b9592",
"en_raw": "That big stump...?"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "bca729e8",
"en_raw": "Yes, yes, that tree"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "fcbd51bd",
"en_raw": "A sacred tree"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "0f5095a8",
"en_raw": "is a tree of the gods"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "6cf77561",
"en_raw": "I'd think even you know that"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "bfa27838",
"en_raw": "And to cut it down so carelessly"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "572d335a",
"en_raw": "and on top of that, spread that noise"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "2aa18f4e",
"en_raw": "Hey"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "46843479",
"en_raw": "Even if you weren't a bird"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "f54ccdb7",
"en_raw": "you'd run away, wouldn't you"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "752d8fea",
"en_raw": "Was it that kind of tree..."
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "dfa29788",
"en_raw": "There's a forest at the edge of town"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "e0e9d25e",
"en_raw": "It's grown"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "c86e0269",
"en_raw": "so small, but"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "25548384",
"en_raw": "when I was young"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "3b16c914",
"en_raw": "it stretched to here"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "18275c5d",
"en_raw": "all the way"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "41a9338e",
"en_raw": "Hirumi was"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "729b196d",
"en_raw": "a small town on a mountain pass"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "26d91bb6",
"en_raw": "And there were"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "2df01f9c",
"en_raw": "many other gods too"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "884350f7",
"en_raw": "Now"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "e831622f",
"en_raw": "hardly any remain"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "06625cb1",
"en_raw": "...Yes, this mound of Lord Naruko"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "58294ef0",
"en_raw": "the lady of the grove by the river"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "8075b0a0",
"en_raw": "Warashimori, Toritsuka"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "96657645",
"en_raw": "the Inari of Tsukazato"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "b6681806",
"en_raw": "Oh yes, an unusual one"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "77de349c",
"en_raw": "a shrine enshrining"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "b2c44679",
"en_raw": "a cat god existed too"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "ce0bb032",
"en_raw": "...Narukozuka, Himenomori, Warashimori"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "387f8849",
"en_raw": "Toritsuka, Inari, the cat"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "e6f5e542",
"en_raw": "How many is that now, dear?"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "5d9fb48f",
"en_raw": "Narukozuka, Himenomori"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "e56721f4",
"en_raw": "Warashimori"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "5f018d89",
"en_raw": "Inari, Toritsuka"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "12992e4a",
"en_raw": "...And the cat god?"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "3e17da16",
"en_raw": "I think it's six"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "96611d08",
"en_raw": "I'd say"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "9a21eda7",
"en_raw": "Oh dear, one's missing"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "f02e0816",
"en_raw": "Which one could it be"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "0f19a453",
"en_raw": "I can't seem to recall..."
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "422b736b",
"en_raw": "Anyway"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "40b0dd5e",
"en_raw": "they were called the Seven Gods of Hirumi"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "61b7b7f1",
"en_raw": "there were seven"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "cc680dc3",
"en_raw": "Sacred trees like this"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "31e60a8f",
"en_raw": "and all sorts of things"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "5d6a5892",
"en_raw": "But"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "c38e8893",
"en_raw": "the things I know"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "044fc6f9",
"en_raw": "keep disappearing, one by one"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "cd77e78e",
"en_raw": "Many people seem to get"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "fdf8813c",
"en_raw": "headaches here"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "3fd234fe",
"en_raw": "Then, is that"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "5b40b9b5",
"en_raw": "because the sacred tree was cut..."
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "13db6c6d",
"en_raw": "He's probably still keeping it up"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "7e73a1e0",
"en_raw": "There's a saying"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "8671b0e5",
"en_raw": "about divine punishment"
},
{
"n": 186,
"h": "1798c282",
"en_raw": "but could such a thing"
},
{
"n": 187,
"h": "07521f1c",
"en_raw": "really happen, I wonder"
},
{
"n": 188,
"h": "e053d17f",
"en_raw": "Don't you believe it"
},
{
"n": 189,
"h": "9c0df0a7",
"en_raw": "either, granny?"
},
{
"n": 190,
"h": "64884478",
"en_raw": "My dear"
},
{
"n": 191,
"h": "22dcdf84",
"en_raw": "it wouldn't do"
},
{
"n": 192,
"h": "84a31a38",
"en_raw": "to frighten children"
},
{
"n": 193,
"h": "d0ebcc77",
"en_raw": "so that's all I'm saying"
},
{
"n": 194,
"h": "5c24e60c",
"en_raw": "Well, truthfully"
},
{
"n": 195,
"h": "bc4c52c2",
"en_raw": "...I can't say it loudly"
},
{
"n": 196,
"h": "59c21ec4",
"en_raw": "because it'd be rude to the workers"
},
{
"n": 197,
"h": "2cbe8e5b",
"en_raw": "but if the work stopped by divine punishment"
},
{
"n": 198,
"h": "a96a037b",
"en_raw": "there'd surely be a feeling"
},
{
"n": 199,
"h": "b8ab6f12",
"en_raw": "of relief"
},
{
"n": 200,
"h": "754ff244",
"en_raw": "...Ah, thank you"
},
{
"n": 201,
"h": "33c1b0a6",
"en_raw": "a feeling that"
},
{
"n": 202,
"h": "fa717eb8",
"en_raw": "the gods were really here..."
},
{
"n": 203,
"h": "9d3dc500",
"en_raw": "That might be"
},
{
"n": 204,
"h": "365f262c",
"en_raw": "a bit difficult"
},
{
"n": 205,
"h": "a380672d",
"en_raw": "for you to grasp"
},
{
"n": 206,
"h": "7ae74743",
"en_raw": "Even if I stay here today"
},
{
"n": 207,
"h": "c3070d10",
"en_raw": "they probably won't let me in"
},
{
"n": 208,
"h": "0c7157d0",
"en_raw": "Well then, excuse me"
},
{
"n": 209,
